@* ============================================================================
   TelemetryMonitor — S29 Path Gamma: 파이프라인 디스패치 링 락-프리 관제탑
   PeriodicTimer(150ms) + RingTelemetryChannel.TryRead 세쿼록 단방향 폴링.
   TryRead false → 직전 프레임 유지(StateHasChanged 불호출, 코어 무블록).
   SendErrors > 0 → 비상 경보 오버레이(downstream throw = 비상 동결 신호).
   ============================================================================ *@
@page "/broker/pipeline"
@implements IAsyncDisposable
@using System.Threading
@inject RingTelemetryChannel Channel
@inject OrderAttestationService Attestation
@inject StrategyEvolutionPipeline Pipeline
@inject DeterministicWarmRestartEngine Recovery
@inject DeterministicChaosGrid Chaos
@inject NewsIntelController NewsIntel
@inject MmfFlightRecorder Blackbox
@inject LiveAccountingMesh Accounting
@inject ShadowExecutionGateway Gateway
@inject AtomicCutoverGate Cutover
@inject LiveAccountGenesis Genesis
@inject CanaryLiveProbe CanaryProbe
@inject BlastRadiusLimiter BlastRadius
@inject RemoteKillSwitch KillSwitch
@inject DeadmanReverseCutover Deadman
@inject LiveSessionWatchdog Watchdog
@inject AutonomousFailoverController Failover
@inject ThreadStarvationSensor Starvation
@inject AdaptiveOrphanReaper OrphanReaper
@inject MicroLiquiditySlicer Slicer
@inject AdaptiveOrderThrottle Throttle
@inject ToxicFlowSentinel Toxic
@inject HotStrategyReloadGate ReloadGate
@inject StrategyStateCarrier StateCarrier
@inject ZombieAssemblyShield Zombie
@inject MultiStrategyInterleavedMesh Mesh
@inject RealTimeBasketNetter Netter
@inject WashTradeGuard WashGuard
@inject CrossStrategyContagionFirewall Firewall
@inject ZeroAllocAsyncCompressedLogger Ms2Logger
@inject KernelJitterSpikeSentinel KernelJitter
@inject IoBackpressureFirewall IoFirewall
@inject IJSRuntime JS

<div class="top">
    <div class="hello">
        <h1>📡 파이프라인 관제 <span class="tag">DISPATCH RING TELEMETRY</span></h1>
        <p>SPMC 주문 디스패치 링의 실시간 지표 — 150ms 락-프리 폴링, 코어 무블록. SendErrors &gt; 0 = 비상 동결 확인.</p>
    </div>
</div>

