    <div class="kpi-card @(aBreach ? "kpi-alert" : (aFall ? "kpi-amber" : (aZmm ? "kpi-hotswap-ok" : "")))" style="margin-bottom:22px">
        <div class="kpi-label">⚡ AVX-512 Ultra-Low Latency SIMD Micro-Alpha (초저지연 미시 알파 · ZMM 점적)</div>
