        <div style="position:fixed;top:120px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:99999;pointer-events:none;background:rgba(74,20,140,0.96);color:#e1bee7;padding:12px 30px;border:2px solid #ce93d8;border-radius:0 0 14px 14px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(123,31,162,0.8)">
            <div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:800">🟣 [QUANTUM VAULT BREACH - UNAUTHORIZED MEMORY ACCESS · SELF-DESTRUCT]</div>
            <div style="font-size:12px;margin-top:3px;font-family:var(--mono)">디버거/스크래핑 @(_frame.QuantumVaultBreached != 0 ? "TRIPPED" : "-") · 디코이 @(_frame.HoneyDecoyTripped != 0 ? "CONTACT" : "-") · 시크릿 제로화 @_frame.VaultZeroizedBuffers · FORENSIC 0x@(qForensic.ToString("X"))</div>
