            </div>
            <div style="min-width:210px">
                <div class="kpi-value" style="font-size:14px">허니키 디코이 <b style="color:@(_frame.HoneyDecoyTripped != 0 ? "#ce93d8" : "#66bb6a")">@(_frame.HoneyDecoyTripped != 0 ? "CONTACT" : "INTACT")</b></div>
                <div class="kpi-sub">Native API 후킹 <b style="color:@(qHook ? "#ffb74d" : (_frame.AntiHookState == 2 ? "#9e9e9e" : "#66bb6a"))">@(_frame.AntiHookState switch { 1 => "TAMPERED", 2 => "N/A", _ => "CLEAN" })</b></div>
            </div>
            <div style="min-width:230px">
                <div class="kpi-value" style="font-size:14px">인프라 결합도 <b style="font-family:var(--mono);color:@(coupling > 0 && coupling < 100 ? "#66bb6a" : "#ffb74d")">@coupling.ToString("N0")</b></div>
                <div class="kpi-sub">infra-scan 래칫(비회귀) · RCU Config 세대 <b style="font-family:var(--mono)">@_frame.RcuConfigVersion.ToString("N0")</b></div>
